// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x0039EC1E size=187 name=?getGenericScript@TeamPrototype@@QAEPAVScript@@HPAVAsciiString@@@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
Script *TeamPrototype::getGenericScript(Int scriptToRetrieve, AsciiString *nameOut)
{
	if (!m_retrievedGenericScripts)
	{
		// Look the scripts up once and keep a copy of each; the prototype owns the copies.
		m_retrievedGenericScripts = TRUE;
		for (Int i = 0; i < MAX_GENERIC_SCRIPTS; ++i)
		{
			Script *scriptToSave = NULL;
			AsciiString scriptName;
			if (!m_teamTemplate.m_teamGenericScripts[i].isEmpty())
			{
				const Script *found = static_cast<const Script *>(TheScriptEngine->findScriptInScope(m_ownerName, m_teamTemplate.m_teamGenericScripts[i], &scriptName));
				if (found)
					scriptToSave = found->duplicate();
			}

			m_genericScriptsToRun[i] = scriptToSave;
			if (scriptToSave)
				m_genericScriptNames[i].set(scriptName);
		}
	}

	Script *script = m_genericScriptsToRun[scriptToRetrieve];
	if (script && nameOut)
		nameOut->set(m_genericScriptNames[scriptToRetrieve]);
	return script;
}

